":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-03-07T22:46:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T14:11:44Z","closed_at":"2025-03-09T14:11:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103778","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103778","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103778.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103778.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-09T14:11:35Z"},"body":"Building with the following params (note: scu_build is enabled):\r\n\r\n```\r\nplatform=linuxbsd builtin_embree=yes builtin_enet=no\r\nbuiltin_freetype=yes builtin_graphite=yes builtin_harfbuzz=yes\r\nbuiltin_libogg=no builtin_libpng=yes builtin_libtheora=no\r\nbuiltin_libvorbis=no builtin_libwebp=no builtin_miniupnpc=no\r\nbuiltin_pcre2=no builtin_zlib=yes builtin_zstd=no linker=mold\r\noptimize=none debug_symbols=True tests=True dev_mode=True dev_build=True\r\nuse_llvm=yes use_lld=yes opengl3=no openxr=no disable_xr=yes -j 24\r\nscu_build=yes scu_limit=256\r\n```\r\n\r\nResults in compiler errors:\r\n\r\n```\r\nIn file included from servers/register_server_types.cpp:99:\r\nservers/xr/xr_interface.h:52:7: error: redefinition of 'RefCounted'\r\n   52 | class XRInterface : public RefCounted {\r\n      |       ^\r\n./servers/rendering/rendering_method.h:40:21: note: expanded from macro\r\n'XRInterface'\r\n   40 | #define XRInterface RefCounted\r\n      |                     ^\r\n./core/object/ref_counted.h:37:7: note: previous definition is here\r\n   37 | class RefCounted : public Object {\r\n      |       ^\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis happens because of:\r\n\r\n```\r\n#ifdef XR_DISABLED\r\n// RendererSceneCull::render_camera is empty when 3D is disabled, but\r\n// it and RenderingMethod::render_camera have a parameter for\r\nXRInterface.\r\n#define XRInterface RefCounted\r\n#else\r\n#include \"servers/xr/xr_interface.h\"\r\n#endif // XR_DISABLED\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn rendering_method.h\r\n\r\n\r\nThe problem was introduced in #103267","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103778/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103778/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}